 <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 10px auto; background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #f0f8ff, #ffffff); padding: 35px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08); font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 26px; color: #1a1a1a; margin-bottom: 20px;">Hello {{userName}},</h1>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #333; line-height: 1.6;">
      Welcome to <strong>{{companyName}}</strong> 🎉 We're thrilled to have you here.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #333; line-height: 1.6;">
      To start using your account, please verify your email address by clicking the button below:
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
    <a href="{{link}}" target="_blank" style="background-color: #0066cc; color: #fff; padding: 14px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;">
      Verify Email
    </a>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #555; line-height: 1.6;">
      If you didn’t create an account, you can safely ignore this message or contact our support team if you have any concerns.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #555; line-height: 1.6;">
      Thank you for joining <strong>{{companyName}}</strong>. We're excited to serve you!
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #555; margin-top: 20px;">Warm regards,</p>
    <h3 style="color: #222;">The {{companyName}} Team</h3>
  </div>
</div>

  